```gitignore
# Compiled and build artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.o
*.obj
*.class
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.a
*.out

# Dependencies
node_modules/
venv/
.venv/
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Build directories
dist/
build/
target/
*.min.js
*.min.css

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo

# Editors and IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage and testing
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# Compression and archives
*.zip
*.gz
*.tar
*.tgz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.7z
*.rar
*.zst
*.lz4
*.lzh
*.cab
*.arj
*.rpm
*.deb
*.Z
*.lz
*.lzo
```
Nothing needs to be added to .gitignore since only a README.md file was added, which is a source/config file and not a build artifact, dependency, or temporary file.
